{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>For He has poured.</b> From the root of מסכה, narrow, like התכנס (Isaiah 28:20), and the kaf is upon you, men of Zion:" "<b>And covered them.</b> From the root of עצם, as though He placed a bone over your eyes:" "And behold, <b>He covered</b> is an infinitive construct on the word נסך:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:49.035713696Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}